      },
      "lineNbr": 24,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000097
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-05-08T18:52:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This can be used by any other service (for e.g. we used OltApp to provision a subscriber only if it\u0027s already authenticated). We created a REST API on the OLT App to provision a subscriber (but that needs the connectPoint of the subscriber and it should already be authenticated); and it is available at that point only with the AAA App.",
      "parentUuid": "ba092121_5eb5b3cb",
      "revId": "c74cbc43011bf331e3260357cf4236f4346eae74",
      "serverId": "2a2bfe1b-c5c2-48ed-9ac8-16438ab24388",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "ba092121_3ecaff4f",
        "filename": "app/src/main/java/org/opencord/aaa/AaaConfig.java",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 39,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000034
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-05-08T04:51:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "NAS_IDENTIFIER is added to the AaaConfig Class. However, the NAS_IDENTIFIER is an identifier used by the Radius Server  to uniquely identify the OLT. If the AAA app is serving multiple OLTs, and if it is set in AaaConfig class, how can the the Radius Server identify the OLT? Therefore the NAS_IDENTIFIER should be the OLT\u0027s name.\nAlso refer to AT\u0026T\u0027s requirement in https://wiki.opencord.org/download/attachments/1966449/EPIC_3_SDN.pdf?version\u003d1\u0026modificationDate\u003d1478138202209\u0026api\u003dv2\n3.2.1.41 The NAS-Identifier in the RADIUS request shall be the TID of the OLT requesting authentication of the port to the RADIUS server. L 2910 \nTherefore NAS-Identifier and DEFAULT_NAS_IDENTIFIER should be removed from AaaConfig class.\nInstead, suggest to add the \"DeviceName\" as configuration for the accessDevice and use that to fill in the NAS-Identifier. The accessDevice can be retrieved based on the OpenFlow EAPoL PacketIn message is received from the OLT.",
      "revId": "c74cbc43011bf331e3260357cf4236f4346eae74",
      "serverId": "2a2bfe1b-c5c2-48ed-9ac8-16438ab24388",
      "unresolved": false
    },
