      "writtenOn": "2017-05-08T04:51:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What is the need for RADIUS_VLAN_ID? RADIUS packets are carried over external Mngt VLAN which is visible to the compute server. So it is not clear why you need this.",
      "revId": "c74cbc43011bf331e3260357cf4236f4346eae74",
      "serverId": "2a2bfe1b-c5c2-48ed-9ac8-16438ab24388",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "ba092121_9ec10be7",
        "filename": "app/src/main/java/org/opencord/aaa/AaaConfig.java",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 43,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000097
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-05-08T18:52:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The requirement we had got is that the RADIUS server would be accessible only through the Leaf switch (White Box switch) Port connected to the CO-7450. So we need to do a packet out from the Leaf switch port and had to create the packet as expected by the RADIUS server.",
      "parentUuid": "ba092121_1ec73b47",
      "revId": "c74cbc43011bf331e3260357cf4236f4346eae74",
      "serverId": "2a2bfe1b-c5c2-48ed-9ac8-16438ab24388",
      "unresolved": false
