      },
      "lineNbr": 44,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000097
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-05-08T18:52:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The topology that can be addressed with this changes is that a white box switch under ONOS connected to the CO-7450. I don\u0027t see a harm in having an configurable option of going directly to the CO-7450 over UDP socket or using packet outs to communicate with it",
      "parentUuid": "ba092121_fec36736",
      "revId": "c74cbc43011bf331e3260357cf4236f4346eae74",
      "serverId": "2a2bfe1b-c5c2-48ed-9ac8-16438ab24388",
      "unresolved": false
